&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ELECTRICAL INTEGRATION TECHNICIAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Freeform builds AI-native manufacturing systems that unify software, hardware, and physics to produce industrial-scale parts at the speed of human ideation. By treating manufacturing as a single integrated system, we unlock a new era of innovation where complex hardware is designed, built, and scaled without limits. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Electrical Integration Technician, you will work closely with the engineering team to build, wire, test, and bring up the electrical systems behind our advanced metal 3D printing factory, including industrial control cabinets, power distribution, motor and servo drives, harnessing, high-voltage systems, and machine networking. The systems you build will power and coordinate the actuators, sensors, and controllers that run our state-of-the-art additive manufacturing lines, and you will help take them from schematic all the way to a fully commissioned, production-ready line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3D printing experience is not required to be successful here - rather we look for smart, motivated, collaborative individuals who love solving hard problems, learning new skills, teaching others, and creating amazing technology!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/FeB-xBymjf4?si=9_wmo21HNDTmDXK1&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assemble and wire industrial control cabinets and enclosures from electrical drawings — power distribution, servo/VFD motor drives, controllers and I/O, and networking hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build power distribution and machine safety circuits: transformers, breakers, contactors, DC power supplies, and E-stop systems from 480 VAC down to 48/24 VDC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fabricate, route, and terminate cable harnesses and shielded cabling with proper strain relief, shield/drain termination, labeling, and clean wire dress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pull, terminate, and test industrial networking (copper Ethernet/EtherCAT and fiber (SFP+)) and document connectivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support motor, servo, and drive bring-up alongside engineers: mounting, wiring, power-up, and first-pass fault diagnosis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and validate completed cabinets and assemblies without supervision (continuity, insulation resistance, and functional power-up)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support installation and bring-up of complete additive manufacturing lines on the factory floor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with technicians of other trades, build and deploy electro-mechanical assemblies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage lab and build consumables, ensuring stocking of critical materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read and interpret schematics and panel layouts, follow work instructions, and help improve assembly and fabrication processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform planned maintenance and unplanned repairs on factory and lab equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete 6S responsibilities (sort, set in order, shine, standardize, sustain, safety)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of electrical integration experience in an industrial production, controls, or panel-build environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Control panel and cabinet wiring and assembly experience (terminal blocks, DIN rail, ferrules)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with power distribution and low-voltage wiring practices, including proper grounding and bonding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience interpreting schematics, wiring diagrams, and/or blueprints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building cables and harnesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with electrical test instruments (DMM, power supply, insulation and continuity testers, etc.)&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mechanical aptitude. Able to drill, cut, fasten, and mount DIN rail, enclosures, and components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with oscilloscopes and logic analyzers; able to interpret basic waveforms for testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Servo drive and VFD installation or commissioning experience (e.g., Yaskawa, Allen-Bradley, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UL 508A industrial control panel build experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industrial networking experience, terminating and troubleshooting Ethernet, EtherCAT, or fiber (SFP+)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Licensed for high-voltage electrical work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to utilize power tools, hand tools, cranes, forklifts, and other heavy equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift and/or move up to 50 lbs unassisted, climb ladders, and be on your feet for extended periods of time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available and willing to work overtime when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Hawthorne, our vertically integrated facility brings technology development, R&amp;amp;D, and production together under one roof. We operate at the center of LA’s deep tech ecosystem, surrounded by some of the most ambitious hardware innovation happening anywhere in the country.&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;message-body-1771454273221&quot; class=&quot;fui-ChatMessage__body r7802u9 ___vfhe6q0 f10pi13n ftqa4ok f2hkw1w f8hki3x f1d2448m f1bjia2o ffh67wi f1j6vpng f1pniga2 f987i1v f1ffjurs f15bsgw9 f14e48fq f18yb2kv fd6o370 ffwy5si f3znvyf f57olzd f4stah7 f480a47 fs1por5 fk6fouc figsok6 fkhj508 f19n0e5 f9ijwd5 ffzz00n f1ozlkrg f1o0qvyv f9ggezi f1xp5gbu f150uoa4 ffyari3 f16xq7d1 fo7qwa0 fxowb0n f11ghf3q f13aoclr flypziy f10kwr27 fquw1qa fftr39l f13lathq f15hsm81 f2ss68y ffb60jq f8nuap2 f13nk4fk f7jacry fq08z5q fd9af6s fr74w9q fcl9uv6 f13sm7pj f1u6qqly f16wpxbl faim3u9 f6cs3qo fa2w2z3 fd39nx6 f10gn8j9 frcqmxy f1w9ws4k f1ddxkqj fd10euv fvuz61 f1nbc6gw&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;content-1771454273221&quot; class=&quot;fui-Primitive ___11tzqds f1oy3dpc f89hs3r fqtknz5 fyvcxda&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our fast-paced, cross-functional environment is built on close collaboration, and as such, this role requires full-time onsite presence (five days a week), with very limited exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;content-1776896507672&quot; class=&quot;fui-Primitive ___11tzqds f1oy3dpc f89hs3r fqtknz5 fyvcxda&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
