&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Operate equipment to measure material properties such as tensile strength, surface roughness, and microstructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Generate and track quality metrics of printed customer parts such as dimensional accuracy, defect distribution, and surface roughness&lt;/li&gt;
