&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PRODUCTION DEVELOPMENT SUPERVISOR (2ND SHIFT)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Freeform is deploying software-defined, autonomous metal 3D printing factories around the world, bringing the scalability of software to physical production. Our proprietary technology stack&amp;nbsp;leverages&amp;nbsp;advanced sensing, real-time controls, and data-driven learning to produce&amp;nbsp;digitally-verified, flawless parts at unprecedented speed and cost. Our mission is to make the transformative power of 3D printing available to all industries at scale and unlock the future of innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Production Development Supervisor at Freeform, you will sit at the intersection of operational leadership and process innovation. You will lead a team of technicians and machinists executing high-volume post-processing operations&amp;nbsp;for complex&amp;nbsp;metal 3D printed parts. You will develop&amp;nbsp;and scale&amp;nbsp;production processes, provide mentorship and guidance,&amp;nbsp;and be&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;strong force&amp;nbsp;that ensures&amp;nbsp;performance, collaboration, and attitudes are aligned. You will&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;in a fast-paced, dynamic environment where schedules evolve&amp;nbsp;quickly&amp;nbsp;and quality, safety, and reliability are critical. This role requires a combination of strong&amp;nbsp;people&amp;nbsp;leadership, hands-on manufacturing experience, and the technical depth to develop, document, and improve production processes in close partnership with&amp;nbsp;manufacturing&amp;nbsp;and process development teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;3D printing experience&amp;nbsp;is not required to&amp;nbsp;be successful here - rather we look for smart, motivated, collaborative individuals who love solving hard problems and building amazing technology from scratch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/sXfG6ssZ190?feature=shared&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead and supervise a team of technicians, machinists, and fabricators responsible for complex post-processing and machining operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Set daily and weekly work assignments to meet tight schedules while adapting to changing priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide coaching, training, and performance feedback to direct reports, including skills development and career growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own the development, documentation, and continuous refinement of production processes - defining how work gets done, not just ensuring it gets done&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineering and process development to resolve build issues and improve reliability, throughput, and first-pass yield&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Identify&amp;nbsp;process gaps, design trials to address them, and drive implementation of validated improvements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage shop metrics, communicate status and risks to leadership, and drive corrective actions as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Maintain a clean, organized, and audit-ready shop environment while championing safety and efficiency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support equipment qualification, calibration readiness, and preventative maintenance programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Foster a culture of safety, collaboration, accountability, and inclusivity within the shop and across partner teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in an engineering field from an ABET accredited university or college&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in operational leadership and team management in a manufacturing environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to develop, document, and improve production or manufacturing processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strongly prefer candidates coming from leadership development programs like the GE OMLP or similar manufacturing rotational training programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience supervising technicians in a high-volume or high-complexity production environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with process development methodologies, design of experiments, or lean/continuous improvement frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Familiarity with production metrics, first-pass yield, OEE, or similar operational KPIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities simultaneously&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to document processes clearly and concisely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Comfort working extended hours or overtime when needed to support critical milestones&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Based in Hawthorne, our vertically integrated facility brings technology development, R&amp;amp;D, and production together under one roof. We&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;at the center of LA’s deep tech ecosystem, surrounded by some of the most ambitious hardware innovation happening anywhere in the country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our fast-paced, cross-functional environment is built on close collaboration, and as such, this role requires full-time onsite presence (five days a week), with&amp;nbsp;very limited&amp;nbsp;exceptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have an inclusive and diverse culture that values collaboration, learning, and making deliberate data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer a unique opportunity to be an early and integral member of a rapidly growing company that is scaling a world-changing technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant stock option packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer-paid Medical, Dental, and Vision insurance (premium PPO and HMO options)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traditional and Roth 401(k)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid vacation, sick leave, and company holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Paid Parental Leave and extended transition back to work for the birthing parent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free daily catered lunch and dinner, and fully stocked kitchenette&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Casual dress, flexible work hours, and regular catered team building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As&amp;nbsp;a growing company, the salary range&amp;nbsp;is intentionally wide as we&amp;nbsp;determine&amp;nbsp;the most&amp;nbsp;appropriate package&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;each individual&amp;nbsp;taking into consideration years of experience, educational background, and unique skills and abilities as&amp;nbsp;demonstrated&amp;nbsp;throughout the interview process. Our intent is to offer a salary that is&amp;nbsp;commensurate&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;the company’s current stage of development and allows the employee to grow and develop within a role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW257734310 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW257734310 BCX0&quot;&gt;addition to the significant stock option package, the estimated salary range for this role is $95,000-$130,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW257734310 BCX0&quot;&gt;, plus a shift&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW257734310 BCX0&quot;&gt;differential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW257734310 BCX0&quot;&gt;The upper end of the range is reserved for individuals who&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW257734310 BCX0&quot;&gt;demonstrate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW257734310 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;exceptional experience, deep domain mastery, and a proven history of high performance and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW257734310 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freeform is an Equal Opportunity Employer that values diversity; employment with Freeform is governed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications and will not be influenced in any manner by race, color, religion, gender, national origin/ethnicity, veteran status, disability status, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, mental or physical disability or any other legally protected status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;PRODUCTION OPERATIONS ENGINEER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;Senior-Mechanical-Engineer&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9649&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Freeform builds AI-native manufacturing systems that unify software, hardware, and physics to produce industrial-scale parts at the speed of human ideation. By treating manufacturing as a single integrated system, we unlock a new era of innovation where complex hardware is designed, built, and scaled without limits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As a Production Operations Engineer at Freeform, you will sit at the intersection of manufacturing and operations, keeping complex metal 3D printed parts moving through high-volume post-processing operations. You will track parts through each stage of production, evaluate deviations against drawings and GD&amp;amp;T requirements, and communicate directly with customers and internal teams on part status and disposition. Complex geometries, tight tolerances, and an exacting eye for detail define the work, on parts built for some of the world&#39;s most advanced hardware systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You will operate in a fast-paced, dynamic environment where schedules evolve quickly and rigor and reliability are non-negotiable. This role requires hands-on manufacturing experience, strong communication skills, and the technical depth to read drawings, understand tolerances, and make sound calls under production pressure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/sXfG6ssZ190?feature=shared&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own the day-to-day flow of parts through post-processing, monitoring throughput and flagging issues before they become bottlenecks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Evaluate part rework, deformation, and nonconformance against drawings and GD&amp;amp;T requirements, and determine appropriate disposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Communicate part status, rework decisions, and deviations directly with customers and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Support test procedures and inspection steps to ensure parts meet requirements before shipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Work with manufacturing development engineers to flag recurring process issues and provide floor-level feedback on tooling and fixturing performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate, up-to-date production tracking and documentation to support traceability and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Help identify bottlenecks and inefficiencies in how parts, materials, and data move through the factory, and work with cross-functional teams to resolve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in mechanical, manufacturing, or related engineering field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Internship or professional experience in manufacturing, production, or quality engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working with hand tools, machinery, or complex hardware assembly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to read engineering drawings and communicate clearly with customers on technical topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;2+ years of experience in a hands-on production, manufacturing, or quality engineering role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of GD&amp;amp;T and drawing interpretation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience with metal additive manufacturing, machining, or precision post-processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience evaluating nonconformances, rework, or part deformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with MRP/ERP tools and production tracking systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Direct customer-facing experience in a manufacturing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to prioritize and make sound judgment calls under production pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
