&lt;li&gt;In addition to the significant stock option package, the estimated salary range for this role is $140,000-$200,000&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;. The upper end of the range is reserved for individuals who demonstrate exceptional experience, deep domain mastery, and a proven history of high performance and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
