&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11506&quot;&gt;Perform tolerance analysis of designs at the system and subsystem level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11581&quot;&gt;Plan and perform tests to analyze the feasibility, design, operation and performance of equipment, components, and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11707&quot;&gt;Work hands-on to build, integrate, and validate designs and newly developed systems and/or subsystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11812&quot;&gt;Strategize continuous improvement plans to enhance system performance, reliability, and manufacturability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11950&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
