&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;SENIOR TECHNICAL RECRUITER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Freeform builds AI-native manufacturing systems that unify software, hardware, and physics to produce industrial-scale parts at the speed of human ideation. By treating manufacturing as a single integrated system, we unlock a new era of innovation where complex hardware is designed, built, and scaled without limits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are&amp;nbsp;looking for&amp;nbsp;an experienced&amp;nbsp;Technical&amp;nbsp;Recruiter to&amp;nbsp;play a critical role in building the team that is creating the world’s most advanced metal 3D printing&amp;nbsp;technology&amp;nbsp;(build the team, who&amp;nbsp;builds&amp;nbsp;the machines, that build the machines). You will&amp;nbsp;run a full desk focused on sourcing, screening, interviewing, and onboarding top talent. You&amp;nbsp;will work closely with&amp;nbsp;your teammates&amp;nbsp;and company leadership to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;areas of improvement in the&amp;nbsp;recruiting process&amp;nbsp;and will implement measures to drive&amp;nbsp;innovation, efficiency, and standards&amp;nbsp;of excellence within hiring practices.&amp;nbsp;You will have an opportunity to&amp;nbsp;recruit&amp;nbsp;a wide variety of&amp;nbsp;deep-tech&amp;nbsp;(software, ML, hardware engineering), operational, and leadership level disciplines, and will get to play a part in new initiatives such as&amp;nbsp;outreach events and&amp;nbsp;employer branding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The right person for this role will have a “no job too big or small” mentality, an unwaveringly&amp;nbsp;positive attitude,&amp;nbsp;a mission-driven mindset, a team-oriented attitude, and&amp;nbsp;zero&amp;nbsp;ego.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
