&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;STAFF/LEAD MANUFACTURING DEVELOPMENT ENGINEER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Freeform builds AI-native manufacturing systems that unify software, hardware, and physics to produce industrial-scale parts at the speed of human ideation. By treating manufacturing as a single integrated system, we unlock a new era of innovation where complex hardware is designed, built, and scaled without limits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;673&quot; data-end=&quot;1168&quot;&gt;As a Staff/Lead Manufacturing Development Engineer, you will lead the design and implementation of novel factory technologies to accelerate and automate our post-processing and part delivery operations. This role blends deep technical engineering development with hands-on manufacturing implementation. You will apply first-principles thinking to streamline operations, eliminate inefficiencies, and pioneer scalable, robust processes for the world’s first high-throughput metal 3D printing factory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a highly technical and hands-on engineer with a background in hardware development and a passion for building the future of manufacturing. This is a high-impact, cross-functional role with opportunities for leadership and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/sXfG6ssZ190?feature=shared&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement scalable systems and processes to automate post-print operations, reduce lead time, and enable factory throughput expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead development and integration of new manufacturing hardware and tooling to support next-generation factory architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and eliminate process inefficiencies using first-principles analysis and a data-driven approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a force multiplier for R&amp;amp;D teams, bridging development and operations to maximize efficiency and velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with mechanical, electrical, software, and controls engineers to co-develop factory solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement initiatives across the full post-processing workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Mechanical, Aerospace, or related Engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in engineering development or manufacturing engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fast-paced hardware development or manufacturing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in hardware or manufacturing development roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical leadership experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience leading factory buildouts, production line deployment, or automation systems integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in post-processing operations (machining, heat treat, inspection, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with factory infrastructure: power systems, industrial gases, material logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with metal additive manufacturing, CNC machining, casting, or similar complex metal manufacturing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ERP/MRP experience (Oracle, NetSuite, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel/data analysis capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of OSHA/EHS standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
